# Keep ad-hoc interactively-extracted history fixtures out of source
# control — they may contain SQL bodies from real connections. See
# README.md in this directory for the opt-in usage convention.
local-history.jsonl

# The committed fixtures are `desktop-history.jsonl` (v:1, kept for the
# back-compat read path) and `desktop-history-v2.jsonl`; everything else
# in this directory is treated as ad-hoc by default. Add fixtures to the
# allowlist explicitly so a casually-dropped file does not silently
# enter git.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!desktop-history.jsonl
!desktop-history-v2.jsonl
